<view class="page settings-page">
  <view class="settings-list">
    <view class="setting-row" bindtap="toggleReduceMotion">
      <text class="setting-label">减弱动画效果</text>
      <view class="setting-toggle {{reduceMotion ? 'active' : ''}}">
        <view class="setting-toggle-dot"></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="setting-hint">开启后，调音指针与拍点动画将静止，适合对动画敏感的用户。</text>
  </view>
</view>
